## Diagnosis (one-liner)

22+ BG span = params 18M-153M × tokens 2.4MB-246MB × SFT-only. LLM 창발 곡선 기준 **chat-cap emergence threshold (=1B+ params, 100B+ tokens, RLHF)** 한참 아래에서 emerge 강요. 이론 위반이 아니라 **이론대로 fail** → 임계 자체를 빌리거나 우회해야 함.

## Gap to LLM emergence (axis × multiplier)

| axis | LLM emergence | anima current | gap |
|---|---|---|---|
| params | 1B+ chat / 60B+ CoT / 175B ICL | 18M-153M | **10×–1000×** |
| tokens | 100B+ (Chinchilla 18M:0.36B) | ~10M tokens | **10×–10000×** |
| recipe | SFT + RLHF/DPO + CoT data | SFT-only | RL stage 부재 |
| inference | 1-N tokens, optional CoT | 1 sample greedy/sample | best-of-N/refine 부재 |
| eval | human pref (HHH, MT-bench) | 7-cell V4 strict | self-impossibility 미검증 |

## Two levers (only realistic paths)

- **Lever 1 — scale 빌리기**: foundation borrow (LoRA) / distillation (teacher larger LLM → anima student) / RAG (small generator + huge retrieval)
- **Lever 2 — emergence 우회**: inference compute (best-of-N + V4 ranker / self-refine / ToT) / constrained decoding / activation steering

