## Lessons absorbed (post-BG-IY)

(Naming: existing Lessons A-R already taken; J was skipped but H/I are claimed. New BG-IY lessons start at S to continue after R.)

- **Lesson S** — SFT corpus language composition is the binding constraint at <500M scale. English-heavy 50K SFT cannot produce passable Korean V4 output even at 477M. (BG-IY F-IY-4)
- **Lesson T** — Mode-collapse `:::::` on CLM v4 chat output is a `:` suffix attractor at logit p=0.46 (single-forward verified). Decoding artifact, not model failure. Future inference must avoid `:`-terminated prompts and apply repetition_penalty ≥ 1.3 + no_repeat_ngram_size ≥ 2.
- **Lesson U** — Calibration falsifier sets need a corpus_mismatch branch alongside capacity_gap and evaluator_strict. The 3-branch BG-IY spec was incomplete; F-IY-4 added retroactively.
- **Lesson V** — V5-α byte+untie architectural advantage is REAL at training-loss layer (BG-KD 3.28 vs BG-KB 5.31) but does NOT lift V5.8 chat-cap 0/5 floor at 167M-782M scale × 22MB-91MB corpus. Output projection bottleneck (vocab + head untie) is NOT the root cause. (BG-KI/KJ/KK/KL 4-way FAIL_TRUE 2026-05-08)
- **Lesson W** — Mac MPS V5-α 학습 중 macOS 자체 과열/리소스 폭주로 사용자가 BG-KD/KG/KH user-kill (concurrency 문제 아님, 단일 proc도 mac 한계). 장시간 V5-α 류 학습은 H100 ephemeral pod mandatory; mac은 smoke/eval 전용.
